<h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
<p>By using lenadelapi_uploader (the “Service”), you agree to these Terms of Service. If you do not agree, do not use the Service.</p>
<h2>2. Service Description</h2>
<p>lenadelapi_uploader provides tools to create, preview, and publish social media content on behalf of authenticated users via third‑party APIs (including TikTok).</p>
<h2>3. User Accounts and Authorization</h2>
<p>Authentication is performed via OAuth; you grant the Service permission to act on your behalf only for the scopes you approve. You may revoke access at any time.</p>
