<p>Do not use the Service to post illegal, infringing, abusive, or otherwise prohibited content. We may suspend or remove content or accounts that violate these Terms.</p>
<h2>6. Tokens and Credentials</h2>
<p>OAuth tokens and credentials are stored securely. We do not store user passwords. If a token is compromised, revoke it immediately and notify us.</p>
<h2>7. Liability and Disclaimers</h2>
<p>The Service is provided “as is.” To the maximum extent permitted by law, lenadelapi_uploader disclaims warranties and limits liability for damages arising from use of the Service.</p>
<h2>8. Termination</h2>
<p>We may suspend or terminate accounts for violations. You may terminate your account at any time; termination does not remove content already posted to third‑party platforms.</p>
<h2>9. Changes to Terms</h2>
